Please help me.

286
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,440
Man.

287
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:39,920
Looks like a nuisance summer pass.

288
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:46,040
Sorry I made you cry.

289
